                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2335: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morales</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-08T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 8, 1922—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>15. Your April 4, 10 a.m.</p>
                <p>In view of information contained in your April 6, 11 p.m., Department presumes
                    that there is now no necessity for sending warships. Keep Department fully
                    informed of developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
